# Demo fixture JSON files MUST be committed to git so Vercel includes
# them in its build. The Vercel deploy has no backend or DB to regenerate
# them from — git is the source of truth for the demo data shipped to
# judges.
#
# This .gitignore intentionally tracks nothing. Re-run the export script
# (docker compose exec api python -m backend.scripts.export_demo_fixtures)
# whenever a demo prompt changes, then commit the updated JSON files.
